# MRESET to model 512, then reload and trace (cmdref: Session & Files).  MRESET re-allocates every model
# array and unloads the prescription (STATUS says so); the run-limits banner shows the new size.  Until
# 2026-10-16 the scratch re-allocation FAILED ("MACOS: allocate failed!") because two of its arrays were
# missing from the preceding deallocate, and every scratch buffer silently kept the old model's size
# (PLAN_CONSOLIDATION 1.2 (g); red on 6ccd86d).
old $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Cassegrain.in
mreset 512
status
old $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Cassegrain.in
opd 5
/null
# EXPECT: Resetting MACOS model size
# EXPECT: Diffraction grid size is\s+512 by\s+512
# EXPECT: Must load optical data first: use NEW or OLD
# EXPECT: Must load optical data first[\s\S]*?RMS OPD error is\s+1\.293791606D-12
# EXPECT-NOT: allocate failed
# EXPECT-NOT: deallocate failed
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
